    m_Localized: SOMEONE HAS DRAWN STARS ON THE WALL. THEY STILL GLOW.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104178347053056
    m_Localized: IT IS AWAKE. RUN TO THE SURGERY.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1521207307923456
    m_Localized: IT IS ON THE STAIRS. RUN TO THE BOILER ROOM.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1521207379226624
    m_Localized: IT IS COMING BACK DOWN. THE BOILER ROOM.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1521207379226625
    m_Localized: YOU WAKE BY THE LIFT. IT IS STILL DOWN HERE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
